// Clean water, and a chance to be somewhere quiet.
//
// **The one that gives nothing you can hold**, which is what makes it
// interesting. Provocation is the only difficulty dial in the game
// (`SYSTEMS.md` §2.6) and until now the player could only ever *raise*
// it — by cutting, by burning, by pushing through. This is the one
// thing on the route that lowers it, and it costs ground, which is the
// currency the whole journey layer is denominated in.
//
// It also stays out of the shelves entirely. An early draft handed over
// produce and taught the recorder a lesson about gifts you cannot
// spend; see `fallen_carrier`.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
WaypointDef(
    id: "waypoint.seep_pool",
    name: "Seep Pool",
    said: "Clean water, under the roots. Stop a while and wash the smoke off?",
    take: "Stop a while",
    costs: [],
    gives: [],
    // The jungle loses interest in something that stopped and washed.
    provocation: -45,
    paces: -90,
)
